dbi-translate

This tool patches DBI but includes none of it. Users supply their own DBI NRO.

Credits and related work:

- DBI -- the Nintendo Switch homebrew installer/manager this tool patches.
  Authored by duckbill; hosted and maintained on GitHub by rashevskyv.
  https://github.com/rashevskyv/dbi

- dbi-i18n by BohdanBuinich -- the runtime-translation approach for DBI and the
  DBITRNS table format, with which this project's tables are compatible. This project
  is an independent, self-contained reimplementation (offline keystone/capstone rather
  than a devkitA64 toolchain) and shares no source with it.
  https://github.com/BohdanBuinich/dbi-i18n

- DBIPatcher by rashevskyv -- the community translation dataset and localization
  pipeline; its CSVs work directly with `build-table`.
  https://github.com/rashevskyv/DBIPatcher

- Morce3232 -- earlier DBI patching work that inspired the above.
  https://github.com/Morce3232
